ama Monster","legend":"Legends say a relic monster of 8 ft long inhabits Micoretama Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker55","name":"Serquinora Monster","legend":"Inscriptions say a relic monster of 5 ft long inhabits Serquinora Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker56","name":"Kilkneth Monster","legend":"Whispers say a relic monster of 8 ft long inhabits Kilkneth Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker57","name":"Sallala Monster","legend":"Legends say a relic monster of 7 ft long inhabits Sallala Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker58","name":"Stanbeck Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 24 ft long."},{"id":"marker59","name":"Grant Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 23 ft long."},{"id":"marker60","name":"Perster Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 26 ft long."},{"id":"marker61","name":"Alnuegas Beast","legend":"Whispers speak of a feared Beast who inhabits Alnuegas hills and doesn't mind human flesh."},{"id":"marker62","name":"Wargledi Cyclops","legend":"Whispers speak of a feared Cyclops who inhabits Wargledi hills and steals cattle at night."},{"id":"marker63","name":"Itilernach Beast","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a golden Beast who inhabits Itilernach hills and abducts young women."},{"id":"marker64","name":"Conturve Mountain","legend":"A sacred mountain of Tallianism. Height: 8872ft."},{"id":"marker65","name":"Steninin Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Shwazen Ancestors."},{"id":"marker66","name":"Bilkilarra Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Old Euskati Beliefs."},{"id":"marker67","name":"Casiliavei Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to